abstract: "Provisional AI image-based transcription of Bodleian Sinica 88, a 1677 calendar, with partial independent source-adjudicated corrections for canvases 1, 2, 7, 15 and 16. Full independent collation remains incomplete. Includes unresolved readings and source locations. Rights are separated for historical text, new editorial data and source images. No expert certification or source images. No published DOI for this version."
